# C# + TDD (file-scoped)

**Full spec:** [`.cursor/agents/csharp-tdd.md`](../agents/csharp-tdd.md)

When editing `*.cs` under `Game/` or `Tests/`:

- Test-first (red → green → refactor)
- Invoke **`/player`** for orders, report validation, goldens, and docs refresh before commit
- Order or L0–L1 catalog changes: follow **[`docs/architecture/delivery/player-facing-docs-sync.md`](../../docs/architecture/delivery/player-facing-docs-sync.md)** section A/B (rules + human rules + `regenerate-allowlist` / `verb-allowlist.json` for game-host parse + player-agent lint + website tests; tech → `docs/human/basic_technologies.md`)
- Invoke **`/project-architect`** when changing module boundaries or integrations
- Engine version: read `Game/Program.cs` → `EngineVersion`
